# 🎬 Flixx App

A sleek front-end movie discovery app that uses [The Movie Database (TMDB)](https://www.themoviedb.org/) API to display popular films and TV shows.

## 🌟 Features

- 🔍 Browse popular movies
- 🎥 View movie details like poster, release date, and overview
- 🎞️ Navigate between movie and TV pages
- 💅 Built with a responsive, clean UI using HTML, CSS, JavaScript

